<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Telegram uses less memory: the emoji panel keeps only the emoji around what you see, hidden sticker and emoji panels give their previews back, idle cached images become purgeable, and database caches are released while Telegram is in the background&lt;br&gt;• The AI agent can count and rank messages, look up when a member joined and what rights they have, and find a post's public reposts&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• AI agent actions with out-of-range numbers or dates no longer crash Telegram&lt;br&gt;</description>
