<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• The gift marketplace shows your available Grams alongside Stars.&lt;br&gt;• Gift offers keep your amount and duration while fees load and show progress after you accept or withdraw an offer.&lt;br&gt;• After a gift sale is confirmed, Telegram shows separate messages for the acceptance and the sale.&lt;br&gt;• When buying a gift for someone else, on-chain listings are limited to fixed-price sales.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Profile names stay pinned as you scroll, and Shared Media updates the subtitle without overlapping the name.&lt;br&gt;• Profile cover colors stay consistent when reopening profiles without a custom cover color.&lt;br&gt;• Community options stay accessible in single-column mode.&lt;br&gt;• Wallet checks for updated availability before showing an error, and a chat transfer still opens if its row reloads.&lt;br&gt;• TON Connect errors use the app language when a translation is available.&lt;br&gt;</description>
