<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• Create polls in Saved Messages.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Profile gift previews now animate smoothly back into their bubbles when closed.&lt;br&gt;• The message composer and rich-text editor remember your last target language for translation.&lt;br&gt;• Group admins can moderate a participant’s reactions from the reactions menu, with VoiceOver support.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• The Share window sends links, contacts, stories, QR codes, and comments to the selected forum topic.&lt;br&gt;• The media viewer stays on the same photo when new photos arrive.&lt;br&gt;• Public profile photos no longer show an incorrect date.&lt;br&gt;• Polls that allow new options keep Add Option available after you vote. Enabling anonymous voting turns off Add Option.&lt;br&gt;• Pressing Down in chat search no longer hangs when there are no recent chats. Return can open the top result after you change the search.&lt;br&gt;• Rich-message lists align their markers with the text and respect custom numbering. Nested media fits its column, and dividers are centered.&lt;br&gt;• Media slider previews in the rich-text editor keep spoilers covered. Plain-text copies put a quote and its author on separate lines.&lt;br&gt;• Copy Link no longer crashes after triple-clicking at the end of a line.&lt;br&gt;</description>
