<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>• Align Feature changes&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;New:&lt;br&gt;• Manage your own fixed-sale NFT listings from Wallet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Previews of received PDFs and automatic QR and text recognition run in a separate sandboxed process&lt;br&gt;• The updater moved to Sparkle 2: every update is now also verified with an Ed25519 signature&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Profile tabs now change colors together while scrolling, including Files, Links, and Groups.&lt;br&gt;• Profile detail cards use consistent widths and compact spacing.&lt;br&gt;• When macOS is slow to unlock the keychain, Telegram now waits and continues on its own instead of showing an error&lt;br&gt;• Memory used by replaced chat wallpapers is released&lt;br&gt;• Previews of malformed contacts, rich text and SVG files no longer stop the document preview service&lt;br&gt;• Keep bot profile widget headings clear and buttons visible when the profile resizes.&lt;br&gt;• Reveal blocks in streaming message drafts in the correct order.&lt;br&gt;• Crash fixes and stability improvements&lt;br&gt;</description>
